{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Molecules / Product card
  product            Product object
  layout             vertical | horizontal | tile                           (Figma: Layout; tile = Manjula Product card 200:1620)
  quick_add          none | variant-picker                                  (Figma: Quick add)
  show_vendor, show_badge, show_wishlist, show_rating, show_swatches, show_description  booleans (Figma: Show …)
  sizes              sizes attribute for the image, the grid passes it
  loading            eager for above-the-fold cards
  section_id         for unique ids
  class
  Rating reads product.metafields.reviews.rating / rating_count (Shopify standard product reviews metafields).
  Tile (Manjula): Fill-subtle card, square from lg. Packshot centred (product.metafields.custom.solo_image, the bottle
    without packaging, else the featured image), then name • variant, subtitle at 60% and price.
    Mobile (Figma 2795:26123, Hendrik 24 Nov): 12px padding, content at the bottom, image square on top, name in label/base,
    subtitle wraps, then price • variant in one row. Desktop: 24px padding, info in one row, name • variant, subtitle one line.
    Variant label = product.metafields.custom.size (e.g. 100ml), else the first variant title (hidden for a default-only product). Subtitle = product.metafields.custom.product_card_subtitle (single line text), else the titles of
    product.metafields.custom.benefits (list of "Title--Description"), comma separated.
    Hover with a lifestyle image: all text turns white, also a sale price and its struck compare-at price (Hendrik, 21 Nov).
    Desktop hover: a lifestyle photo fades in fast (150ms) behind the bottle, with a bottom shade and on-media text,
    and zooms out slightly from 105% while the bottle zooms in to 102% from its bottom edge (both motion-safe, 500ms). The bottle stays visible on top. The photo is the product
    metafield custom.hover_image (file, image), else the product's second image; with neither it only tints (accent-subtle).
    A hover video (custom.hover_video, file, video) replaces the photo when set: muted and looped, it plays while the
    card is hovered and pauses on leave (assets/card-hover-video.js). It loads on the first hover (preload none); its
    poster frame shows until it plays. It loads Shopify's 720p mp4 (a tile is at most ~350px wide): Liquid only exposes
    the 1080p mp4, so the 720p url is derived from it, with the 1080p source as a fallback if that file is missing. With reduced motion it shows the poster only. Tile ignores quick_add, badge, wishlist, rating and swatches.
  Quick add: variant-picker is a form of submit buttons, one per variant, each adds straight to the cart. Cards never open
  the quick view (Hendrik, 19 Nov); the quick view only shows product details from a bundle item.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign layout = layout | default: 'vertical'
  assign quick_add = quick_add | default: 'none'
  if show_badge == nil
    assign show_badge = true
  endif
  if show_wishlist == nil
    assign show_wishlist = true
  endif
  if show_rating == nil
    assign show_rating = true
  endif
  if show_swatches == nil
    assign show_swatches = true
  endif
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign card_id = 'ProductCard-' | append: section_id | append: '-' | append: product.id

  assign badge_type = nil
  if product.available == false
    assign badge_type = 'sold-out'
    assign badge_label = 'products.product.sold_out' | t
  elsif variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
    assign badge_type = 'sale'
    assign badge_label = 'products.product.on_sale' | t
  endif

  assign rating_value = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating
  assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value

  assign swatch_option = nil
  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign swatch_count = option.values | map: 'swatch' | compact | size
    if swatch_count > 0
      assign swatch_option = option
      break
    endif
  endfor

  if layout == 'horizontal'
    assign root = 'product-card group relative flex gap-6'
    assign media_wrap = 'relative w-50 shrink-0'
    assign ratio = '1:1'
  else
    assign root = 'product-card group relative flex flex-col gap-3'
    assign media_wrap = 'relative'
    assign ratio = '4:5'
  endif
  assign sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 50vw'
  assign add_label = 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t
-%}
{%- if layout == 'tile' -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign tile_variant = product.metafields.custom.size.value
    if tile_variant == blank
      unless product.has_only_default_variant
        assign tile_variant = product.variants.first.title
      endunless
    endif
    assign subtitle = product.metafields.custom.product_card_subtitle.value
    if subtitle == blank
      assign subtitle = ''
      for item in product.metafields.custom.benefits.value
        assign benefit_title = item | split: '--' | first | strip
        if benefit_title == blank
          continue
        endif
        if subtitle != ''
          assign subtitle = subtitle | append: ', '
        endif
        assign subtitle = subtitle | append: benefit_title
      endfor
    endif
    assign packshot = product.metafields.custom.solo_image.value | default: product.featured_media
    assign hover_video = product.metafields.custom.hover_video.value
    if hover_video.media_type != 'video'
      assign hover_video = nil
    endif
    assign lifestyle = product.metafields.custom.hover_image.value
    if hover_video
      assign lifestyle = hover_video
    elsif lifestyle == blank
      assign lifestyle = product.media[1]
      if lifestyle.media_type != 'image'
        assign lifestyle = nil
      endif
    endif
  -%}
  <product-card class="product-card group/tile relative isolate flex flex-col justify-end gap-3 max-lg:h-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-alt p-3 transition-colors lg:aspect-square lg:gap-6 lg:p-6 lg:hover:bg-accent-subtle has-focus-visible:outline-1 has-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 has-focus-visible:outline-focus {% if lifestyle %}lg:hover:[--color-text:var(--color-text-on-media)] lg:hover:[--color-text-muted:var(--color-text-on-media)] lg:hover:[--color-sale:var(--color-text-on-media)]{% endif %} {{ class }}" id="{{ card_id }}" data-layout="tile">
    {%- if lifestyle -%}
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-150 max-lg:hidden lg:group-hover/tile:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 motion-safe:scale-105 motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-500 motion-safe:ease-out lg:group-hover/tile:scale-100">
          {%- if hover_video -%}
            <div class="absolute inset-0" data-hover-video>
              {%- liquid
                assign video_source = hover_video.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | first
                assign video_medium = video_source.url | replace: 'HD-1080p-3.3Mbps', 'HD-720p-2.1Mbps'
              -%}
              <video class="block size-full object-cover" poster="{{ hover_video.preview_image | image_url: width: 720 }}" muted loop playsinline preload="none">
                {%- if video_medium != video_source.url %}<source src="{{ video_medium }}" type="video/mp4">{% endif -%}
                <source src="{{ video_source.url }}" type="video/mp4">
              </video>
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            {% render 'media', media: lifestyle, ratio: 'fill', sizes: sizes, class: 'absolute! inset-0 size-full' %}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-overlay/50 to-transparent to-50%"></div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="flex aspect-square w-full items-center justify-center lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1 lg:py-4 origin-bottom motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-500 motion-safe:ease-out motion-safe:lg:group-hover/tile:scale-102">
      {% render 'media', media: packshot, ratio: '1:1', fit: 'contain', sizes: sizes, loading: loading, class: 'size-full bg-transparent! lg:h-full lg:w-auto' %}
    </div>
    <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-3 text-text lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
      <div class="flex min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col gap-3 lg:gap-2">
        <h3 class="flex items-center gap-1 text-label-base">
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 after:z-0 focus-visible:outline-none">{{ product.title | escape }}</a>
          {%- if tile_variant != blank -%}
            <span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current max-lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="max-lg:hidden">{{ tile_variant | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </h3>
        {%- if subtitle != blank -%}
          <p class="max-w-full text-body-xs opacity-60 lg:truncate">{{ subtitle | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1">
        {% render 'price', product: product, size: 'sm' %}
        {%- if tile_variant != blank -%}
          <span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="text-label-base lg:hidden">{{ tile_variant | escape }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </product-card>
{%- else -%}
<product-card class="{{ root }} {{ class }}" id="{{ card_id }}" data-layout="{{ layout }}" data-quick-add="{{ quick_add }}">
  <div class="{{ media_wrap }}">
    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="block" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
      {% render 'media', media: product.featured_media, ratio: ratio, sizes: sizes, loading: loading %}
    </a>
    {%- if show_badge and badge_type %}{% render 'badge', label: badge_label, type: badge_type, size: 'sm', class: 'absolute top-3 left-3 z-[1]' %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if show_wishlist %}{% render 'wishlist-toggle', product: product, style: 'floating', size: 'sm', class: 'absolute top-2 right-2 z-[1]' %}{% endif -%}

    {%- case quick_add -%}
      {%- when 'variant-picker' -%}
        {%- if product.has_only_default_variant -%}
          <product-form class="absolute inset-x-3 bottom-3 z-[1] lg:opacity-0 lg:transition-opacity lg:group-hover:opacity-100 lg:group-focus-within:opacity-100">
            {%- form 'product', product, class: 'flex', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
              <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}">
              {%- assign add_disabled = false -%}
              {%- unless product.available %}{% assign add_disabled = true %}{% endunless -%}
              {% render 'button', label: add_label, style: 'secondary', size: 'md', type: 'submit', name: 'add', class: 'w-full', disabled: add_disabled %}
            {%- endform -%}
          </product-form>
        {%- else -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign pick_option = product.options_with_values | last
            assign pick_index = pick_option.position | minus: 1
            assign pick_name = pick_option.name | downcase
            assign picker_label = 'products.product.select_option' | t: option: pick_name
          -%}
          <product-form class="absolute inset-x-3 bottom-3 z-[1] lg:opacity-0 lg:transition-opacity lg:group-hover:opacity-100 lg:group-focus-within:opacity-100">
            {%- form 'product', product, class: 'flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-input bg-background p-3', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
              <span class="text-label-sm text-text-muted">{{ picker_label }}</span>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                {%- for value in pick_option.values -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign pick_variant = nil
                    for v in product.variants
                      assign matches = true
                      for opt in product.options_with_values
                        assign i = opt.position | minus: 1
                        if i == pick_index
                          if v.options[i] != value.name
                            assign matches = false
                          endif
                        elsif v.options[i] != variant.options[i]
                          assign matches = false
                        endif
                      endfor
                      if matches
                        assign pick_variant = v
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                    assign sold_out = true
                    if pick_variant and pick_variant.available
                      assign sold_out = false
                    endif
                    assign pill_id = card_id | append: '-' | append: forloop.index
                  -%}
                  {%- if pick_variant -%}
                    {%- if sold_out -%}
                      {% render 'variant-pill', label: value.name, size: 'sm', id: pill_id, type: 'submit', name: 'id', value: pick_variant.id, sold_out: true %}
                    {%- else -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign tip_id = pill_id | append: '-tip'
                        assign pill_attrs = 'aria-describedby="' | append: tip_id | append: '"'
                      -%}
                      {%- capture pill -%}{% render 'variant-pill', label: value.name, size: 'sm', id: pill_id, type: 'submit', name: 'id', value: pick_variant.id, attributes: pill_attrs %}{%- endcapture -%}
                      {% render 'tooltip', trigger: pill, text: add_label, placement: 'top', id: tip_id %}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endform -%}
          </product-form>
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- endcase -%}
  </div>

  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
      {%- if show_vendor %}<span class="text-label-caps text-text-muted">{{ product.vendor }}</span>{% endif -%}
      <h3 class="text-label-base text-text">
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 after:z-0 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">{{ product.title }}</a>
      </h3>
      {%- if show_description and layout == 'horizontal' and product.description != blank %}<p class="text-body-sm text-text-muted line-clamp-2">{{ product.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 }}</p>{% endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- if show_rating and rating_count > 0 %}{% render 'rating', value: rating_value, count: rating_count, size: 'sm' %}{% endif -%}
    {% render 'price', product: product, size: 'sm' %}
    {%- if show_swatches and swatch_option -%}
      <div class="card-swatches relative z-[1] flex items-center gap-1">
        {%- for value in swatch_option.values -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign sold_out = false
            unless value.available
              assign sold_out = true
            endunless
            assign swatch_href = product.url | append: '?variant=' | append: value.variant.id
            if value.variant == blank
              assign swatch_href = product.url
            endif
            assign preview_attrs = ''
            assign variant_media = value.variant.featured_media
            if variant_media
              assign preview_image = variant_media.preview_image
              assign preview_360 = preview_image | image_url: width: 360
              assign preview_720 = preview_image | image_url: width: 720
              assign preview_1080 = preview_image | image_url: width: 1080
              assign preview_attrs = 'data-swatch-preview data-image-src="' | append: preview_720 | append: '" data-image-srcset="' | append: preview_360 | append: ' 360w, ' | append: preview_720 | append: ' 720w, ' | append: preview_1080 | append: ' 1080w"'
            endif
          -%}
          {%- capture swatch_markup -%}{% render 'swatch', swatch: value.swatch, label: value.name, size: 'xs', href: swatch_href, sold_out: sold_out, attributes: preview_attrs %}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- if forloop.index > 4 -%}<span class="contents" data-swatch-extra hidden>{{ swatch_markup }}</span>{%- else -%}{{ swatch_markup }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- if swatch_option.values.size > 4 -%}
          {%- assign overflow = swatch_option.values.size | minus: 4 -%}
          {% render 'swatch-overflow', count: overflow, size: 'xs', attributes: 'data-swatch-more' %}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</product-card>
{%- endif -%}
